  "Interac e-Transfer is available in CAD only. Switch the currency to CAD to use it.": "Interac e-Transfer ir pieejams tikai CAD. Lai to izmantotu, pārslēdziet valūtu uz CAD.",
  "03 — GENERATE ORDER": "03 — IZVEIDOT PASŪTĪJUMU",
